    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present 62 Cabinteely Avenue to the open market, a charming and well-proportioned 3 bedroom semi-detached home ideally positioned on a peaceful cul de sac in this highly sought-after residential location. Extending to approximately 98 sq. m., this bright and spacious property offers excellent family accommodation with well-balanced living and bedroom accommodation throughout. The property benefits from off-street parking to the front and a particularly attractive private rear garden, which is an oasis of tranquillity, perfect for alfresco dining, relaxing and entertaining.\n\nThe accommodation comprises entrance hall, guest WC, living room, kitchen and dining room at ground floor level. Upstairs there are three spacious bedrooms and a family bathroom. The property is further enhanced by a generous garage to the side, which offers wonderful scope for conversion, subject to the necessary planning permissions. A particularly notable feature is the side passageway, which is an increasingly rare benefit in the area and provides excellent access from the front to the rear garden. The bright and spacious accommodation provides an excellent foundation for a new owner to make their own mark and create a wonderful family home.\n\nThe location is superb, with Cabinteely Village and its range of local amenities close by, while Foxrock, Killiney, Dun Laoghaire, Stillorgan and Blackrock are all within easy reach. The N11 provides excellent access to Dublin City Centre and the M50, while the area is also well served by Dublin Bus routes, with the DART and LUAS within convenient reach. There is an excellent selection of schools, parks, playgrounds and recreational amenities nearby, making this an ideal location for families. Number 63 represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a bright and spacious home in a peaceful setting, with the added benefit of valuable future potential.\n\nSpecial Features:\n\n• Excellent 3 bedroom family home\n• Approx. 98 sq. m. of bright and spacious accommodation\n• Peaceful cul de sac setting\n• Private rear garden \n• Generous garage offering wonderful scope for conversion, subject to planning permission\n• Side passageway providing excellent access to the rear garden\n• Off-street parking\n• Well-proportioned and versatile accommodation\n• Three spacious bedrooms\n• Bright and welcoming living accommodation\n• Guest WC\n• Excellent location close to Cabinteely Village\n• Convenient to the N11, M50, public transport, schools, parks and a host of local amenities"
      },
